  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 16 December 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nNow selling by Deadline Sale. The vendors are super keen to secure a sale and invite your offers.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned, you can pick up a coffee, walk the kids to school, pop to the gym or get groceries without taking the car. From 29/4 Stables Lane, cafés, shops, services and medical care are all within easy walking distance, and the Millwater Estuary is close by for a walk or bike ride.\r\n\r\nPresenting an appealing blend of contemporary comfort, generous proportions and a sunny North-facing aspect, this three-bedroom, two-bathroom corner home has light-filled open-plan living that opens onto a private courtyard with leafy green outlook. Constructed by the reputable Broadway Property Group, a well-run body corporate secures your investment. With no ongoing maintenance worries or lawns to mow, it’s easy to lock up and head away for the weekend - or simply make the most of everything the Hibiscus Coast has to offer. The thoughtfully designed interior, excellent storage, double glazing and reverse cycle heat pump mean this home effortlessly balances relaxed living with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nComplemented two secure covered parks downstairs, along with a separate basement storage for surf boards, tools and everything you’d usually keep in the garage, there is also secure bike storage - perfect for rides around the estuary.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n• Three generously proportioned, light and bright bedrooms, each complete with spacious wardrobes.\r\n• Separate main bathroom, complemented by the master ensuite.\r\n• Appealing urban outlook with leafy outlook.\r\n• Double glazing throughout and a heat pump for year-round comfort.\r\n• Excellent storage, providing ample room for belongings.\r\n• Zoned for Silverdale School and Orewa College.\r\n• Conveniently located just minutes from Millwater shops and services, Silverdale Shopping Centre and Orewa Town Centre.\r\n• Enjoy Merto Park East and the Orewa Estuary Walk right on your doorstep, with world-class beaches on your doorstep\r\n\r\nWith the vendors sights firmly set on their next move this exciting opportunity presents itself for you to secure this appealing Millwater residence. Whether you are seeking a refined lock-and-leave lifestyle or a secure home close to everyday amenities, 29/4 Stables Lane deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nGet in touch with us to arrange a viewing or request the property information and Deadline Sale details.",
